Package: pve-smartraidmon
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         pve-manager (>= 8.0),
         libpve-http-server-perl,
         smartmontools,
         perl,
Description: Proxmox VE HP Smart Array S.M.A.R.T. Monitor
 A Proxmox VE plugin that provides a web GUI for monitoring
 S.M.A.R.T. data on drives behind HP Smart Array (CCISS)
 controllers. Uses smartctl with -d cciss,N to query drive
 health, attributes, and self-test results.
